The serving image built from this repository is based on upstream
SGLang (https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang) and includes a
fused-checkpoint loader fix and the logprobs guard from SGLang PR
#35052 (https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/35052), with an
in-build regression test from SGLang PR #35852
(https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/35852). Upstream license
files are preserved in the image.

The model weights (decisor-4b) are distributed separately at
https://huggingface.co/underlabs/decisor-4b, with their own LICENSE
and NOTICE.
